# Phase 11 hold-SELECT menu from lists (docs/phase11-brief.md section
# 3.3, U1; owner photo hold-select-popup-np-b): a full-screen ordinary
# list under the normal header, no chevrons, Cancel last. A song gets
# Add to On-The-Go / Browse Album / Browse Artist / Cancel; an album row
# Add to On-The-Go / Cancel; a podcast episode no Browse items (Rev 1
# L-6). The release of the opening hold never acts (Add stays unpressed:
# the menu is still up after it). Adding never touches the playing queue
# (⚠️ H3): nothing plays before or after.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-hold-list.script
# needs: library
# golden: skip
# log: hold open ctx=song items=77
# log: hold open ctx=group items=65
# log: hold act add
# log: hold act album
# log: hold act artist
# log: hold act cancel
#
# items = the ui_hold_items() mask: Add 1, Remove 2, Browse Album 4,
# Browse Artist 8, Cancel 16. The store is L's (otg.c); the adds are
# checked with otg_dump once it lands.

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
wait_db 30000

key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +3 300        # "Songs"  [Compilations off: P11]
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +2 300        # the third song
wait 400
hold SELECT 1500    # the hold menu; its own release is dropped
wait 600
shot hold_song      # Add to On-The-Go (selected) / Browse Album /
                    # Browse Artist / Cancel; header "Songs"
key SELECT          # Add to On-The-Go
wait 800
shot added          # back on Songs, the same row selected, no splash
expect_queue 0 -    # nothing plays: Add never builds a queue

hold SELECT 1500
wait 600
wheel +1 300        # Browse Album
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot browse_album   # the song's album, its title in the header
key MENU            # back to Songs (the menu has left)
wait 800
shot back_songs

hold SELECT 1500
wait 600
wheel +2 300        # Browse Artist
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot browse_artist  # the artist's albums, "All Songs" first
key MENU
wait 800
key MENU            # Music
wait 800

wheel -2 300        # "Albums"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
hold SELECT 1500    # an album row
wait 600
shot hold_group     # Add to On-The-Go / Cancel
wheel +1 300        # Cancel
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot cancelled      # back on Albums
key MENU            # Music
wait 800
key MENU            # main menu
wait 800

wheel +1            # "Podcasts"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
key SELECT          # "Signal Hour": its episodes
wait 800
hold SELECT 1500
wait 600
shot hold_episode   # Add to On-The-Go / Cancel: no Browse items
key MENU            # MENU pops the menu like Cancel
wait 800
shot episodes       # dots, no progress bar (⚠️ P1)

otg_dump
quit
